# Sinkmarket Floor (CIPlay sinkmarket_floor): 30 m down; the ballast stone, the ledger, the diving bell, the cistern valve
# and its air, the stingrays, the cistern store (Marn's key), her cage, satchel and map, the cable car's bottom station.
island Sinkmarket Floor
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Sunken Square
zone ballast_stone
expect step 1
read Sinkmarket ledger
expect step 2
air bell
expect step 3
read Bell keeper's log
expect step 4
use valve
expect story drained 1
expect step 5
air cistern
expect step 6
zone cistern_hall
kill Stingray
expect step 7
open Cistern store
wait 3
expect step 11
use marncage
expect survivor gravity_ilse
open Marn's satchel
wait 3
expect step 12
read Marn's map
expect step 13
zone cable_bottom
expect done
